,0.04608031,-0.03085436,-0.0031222,-0.09259558,-0.00688789,0.04103996,0.17034358,-0.02820317,-0.02017333,0.03805359,-0.00859612,-0.05598317,0.01411912,0.02599894,-0.01583066,0.00396654,0.15080452,-0.01974509,0.02229102,0.06600044,-0.03055629,-0.03036698,-0.0117812,-0.01597965,0.08807654,0.00290738,-0.00718335,-0.06625962,0.08768945,0.01815696,0.00206119,-0.06270698,-0.04323341,-0.00675631,0.02818977,0.00807371,-0.01623751,-0.0120088,0.05181301,-0.02657115,0.02594672,0.00561007,0.01851963,-0.0152504,0.05512455,-0.01748691,-0.01776914,0.07727814,-0.03059192],"last_embed":{"hash":"5wdo11","tokens":437}}},"last_read":{"hash":"5wdo11","at":1778067901108},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939523000,"size":4158,"at":1778067901109,"hash":"5wdo11"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis":[20,46],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#{1}":[21,25],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,32],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#📝 Benim Notlarım#{1}":[27,28],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#📝 Benim Notlarım#{2}":[29,32],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[33,35],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[36,38],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[37,38],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[39,41],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[40,41],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[42,44],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[43,44],"#Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[45,46]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/HLSNXP6N","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/Q2X4UA7U?page=1&annotation=RHLSLXAA","line":37},{"title":"Sayfa 10","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/Q2X4UA7U?page=10&annotation=HGH3UGVF","line":40},{"title":"Sayfa 10","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/Q2X4UA7U?page=10&annotation=FS7LRMSF","line":43}],"metadata":{"Title":"Dietary Assessment With Multimodal ChatGPT: A Systematic Analysis","Authors":"Frank P.-W. Lo, Jianing Qiu, Zeyu Wang, Junhong Chen, Bo Xiao, Wu Yuan, Stamatia Giannarou, Gary Frost, Benny Lo","Year":2024,"DOI":"10.1109/JBHI.2024.3417280","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"In this study, we explore the application of GPT-4V powering multimodal ChatGPT for dietary assessment, along with prompt engineering and passive monitoring techniques. We evaluated the proposed pipeline using a self-collected, semi free-living dietary intake dataset, captured through wearable cameras. Our findings reveal that GPT-4V excels in food detection under challenging conditions without any fine-tuning or adaptation using food-specific datasets","Findings":"In conclusion, this study highlights the satisfactory performance of GPT-4V, a multimodal foundation model that powers the latest ChatGPT, in identifying food items from a dietary intake dataset collected under semi free-living conditions, without the need for specific fine-tuning. Its ability to accurately recognize food items, including common staples and even regional dishes such as banku and ugali, through the use of specific language prompts, is particularly noteworthy. Additionally, GPT-4V’s contextual awareness allows it to use surrounding objects as scale references, thereby facilitating the accurate calculation of consumed portion sizes.When compared to estimates by dietitians, GPT-4V demonstrates comparable performance but with relatively higher consistency","Conclusions":"This capability shows GPT-4V’s potential as an alternative tool for scenarios requiring automated large-scale dietary assessment, effectively assisting dietitians and reducing their burden.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"dyt karşılaştrması var  prompt var  yine de doğrula"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"5wdo11","at":1774939752133},"key":"Augmented Dietitian/loDietaryAssessmentMultimodal2024b.md"},
